@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<section class="container my-5">
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-10">
            <div class="card shadow-sm">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h1 class="card-title text-center mb-1">@ViewData["Title"]</h1>
                    <p class="text-center text-muted small mb-4">Last updated: July 15, 2026</p>

                    <p class="lead">FINAPSA is committed to protecting your privacy. This policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, and the controls you have over your data when using our learning platform.</p>

                    <hr />

                    <h4 class="mt-4">1. Information we collect</h4>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Account information you provide during registration (name, admission number, email).</li>
                        <li>Usage data such as courses viewed, progress, and preferences to personalize your learning experience.</li>
                        <li>Device and technical data (IP address, browser, device type) for performance and security.</li>
                    </ul>

                    <h4 class="mt-4">2. How we use your information</h4>
                    <ul>
                        <li>To provide and improve our services, deliver course content, and track progress.</li>
                        <li>To communicate important notices, account updates, and support responses.</li>
                        <li>To protect the security and integrity of the platform and prevent abuse.</li>
                    </ul>

                    <h4 class="mt-4">3. Cookies and similar technologies</h4>
                    <p>We use cookies and similar technologies to make the site work, remember your preferences, and analyze site traffic. You can manage cookie settings in your browser.</p>

                    <h4 class="mt-4">4. Data retention</h4>
                    <p>We retain your personal data only as long as necessary to provide services, comply with legal obligations, and resolve disputes. You may request deletion or export of your data (see Your rights below).</p>

                    <h4 class="mt-4">5. Security</h4>
                    <p>We implement reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect your data. However, no method of transmission over the internet is completely secure.</p>

                    <h4 class="mt-4">6. Third-party services</h4>
                    <p>We may share data with trusted third-party providers that help us deliver the service (hosting, analytics, email). These providers are bound by contract to use data only as necessary to provide services to FINAPSA.</p>

                    <h4 class="mt-4">7. Children's privacy</h4>
                    <p>Our platform is intended for students. If you are under the age required by local law to create an account, please obtain parental or guardian consent before registering.</p>

                    <h4 class="mt-4">8. Your rights</h4>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Access: Request a copy of the personal information we hold about you.</li>
                        <li>Correction: Ask us to correct inaccurate or incomplete data.</li>
                        <li>Deletion: Request deletion of your account and personal data where permitted by law.</li>
                    </ul>

                    <h4 class="mt-4">9. Contact</h4>
                    <p>If you have questions or requests about this policy please <a href="/Home/Contact">contact us</a> or email <a href="mailto:support@finapsa.example">support@finapsa.example</a>.</p>

                    <p class="text-muted small mt-4">By using FINAPSA you acknowledge that you have read and understood this Privacy Policy.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
